    "description": {
      "content": "INTTRA (now part of e2open) provides ocean execution APIs for the world's largest multi-carrier e-commerce platform for global shipping. The RESTful API uses HTTPS with JSON for booking, ocean schedules, rates, and visibility/track and trace products. Authentication requires a bearer token obtained from the identity service before making API requests.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: INTTRA / e2open Support",
